   "source": {
    "label": "thm:regret-safe-bandit",
    "number": "Theorem 3.3",
    "quote": "In the bandit setting under known context distribution and no budget constraint, \\cref{alg:weight-pushing-stoc} with the estimator in \\cref{eq:w-hat-estimate-exp3} runs in $O(|\\mathcal{V}|\\maxbid^2/\\epsilon^3)$ space and time per round. For any $\\epsilon\\in(0, 1)$ and non-increasing sequence $\\eta_t>0$,\n\\[\n    \\mathsf{Reg}_{nb}(T)\\lesssim\\frac{\\maxbid \\log 1/\\epsilon}{\\eta_T} + \\frac{\\maxbid^3}{\\epsilon^3}\\sum_{t=1}^T\\eta_t\\,.\n\\]\nIf $\\eta_t = \\frac{1}{\\maxbid}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\epsilon^3\\log 1/\\epsilon}{t}}, \\forall t$, $\\mathsf{Reg}_{nb}(T)\\lesssim \\frac{\\maxbid^2}{\\epsilon^{3/2}}\\sqrt{T\\log 1/\\epsilon}$."
